<Layout title="About the Company" description="Meet the company behind the construction and remodeling services: Silicon Valley General Builder Contractor."><section class="page-heading section"><p class="eyebrow">SILICON VALLEY GENERAL BUILDER CONTRACTOR</p><h1>Good spaces begin<br/>with <em>understanding.</em></h1></section><section class="about-story section"><img src={img('hero.jpg')} alt="Contemporary living space — architectural reference" width="1200" height="1600"/><div><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL ROOTS. THOUGHTFUL WORK.</p><h2>Built on<br/><em>collaboration.</em></h2><p class="body-copy">Silicon Valley General Builder Contractor describes itself as a family-owned construction business established in 2016. Its published services span new homes, remodeling, commercial construction, historic renovation, and roofing.</p><p class="body-copy muted">Serving San Jose, Santa Clara, Sunnyvale, Mountain View, and Palo Alto, the company focuses on residential and commercial spaces across Silicon Valley.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('services/')}>Explore the expertise ↗</a><p class="caption">Company history is based on its published website. Photography is an architectural reference.</p></div></section><section class="values section dark"><p class="eyebrow">THE APPROACH</p><div class="values-grid">{[['01','Listen first.','A useful conversation starts with how you live, what your property needs, and what you hope to achieve.'],['02','Plan with care.','Resolve the relationship between scope, material, timing, and the practical realities of construction.'],['03','Consider the details.','From structural decisions to visible finishes, thoughtful choices create a coherent whole.']].map(([n,t,p])=><div><span>{n}</span><h2>{t}</h2><p>{p}</p></div>)}</div></section></Layout>
